# Bundling & code splitting (target state)

## Defaults for new heavy UI

Use `React.lazy` + `Suspense` when adding or wiring:

- Admin-only pages
- Event flow editor (`@xyflow/react` / dagre)
- Side-action tab tree
- Large event round / scoring workspaces

Do not eagerly import these into `App.tsx` for brand-new routes.

## Vendor splitting

Respect existing `manualChunks` in `vite.config.ts` (mui, react-query, router, ...). Avoid pulling React Flow into the scoring path.

## Dead weight

Prefer removing unused packages (`formik`, `yup`, `@mui/x-data-grid`) over wiring them. Keep Lighthouse/perf scripts healthy when changing entry routes.
